## Anti-Patterns to Avoid

- **Don't** say "this is fine" — verify it
- **Don't** skip tests — run them
- **Don't** hard-code credentials — use env vars
- **Don't** guess at production targets — always confirm
- **Don't** leave blocking decisions to later — block now
- **Don't** optimize prematurely — ship first, optimize after

